It’s never been so easy for creating collages on your phone.
Unleash Your Creativity and Imagination.

Effortlessly cut out with lightning speed, you could either use the 'Smart Cutout' feature within the 'Tico' app with one-click, or simply long-press a photo from Photos and drag it onto the 'Tico' canvas for cutting out.

Thanks to robust system support, all cutout operations are performed locally, ensuring enhanced photo security.



Features:
1. Unlimited drag and drop to add cutouts;
2. Add strokes, shadows and fancy outlines to cutouts;
3. Decorate the cutouts with filters and color adjustments;
4. Rotate, flip, copy the cutout.
5. Change the canvas background color. The "Intelligent Color" function will automatically recommend colors for you according to the existing cutouts;
6. Add background patterns;
7. Add texts;
8. Add various Tico exclusive stickers;
9. Choose multiple ratios of the canvas to meet different occasions.

Enjoy!

